                                        "entry_id": "d74f2235-6573-354e-b764-94009405aaf0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A female singer; often specifically a popular or cabaret singer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6eb8e831-0f54-4bc1-8e6f-af351e01bf62",
                                                "sense_id": "5be911d1-78c8-34c0-91e0-cc09ba88ce3b",
                                                "text": "Smith could easily be lumped in with expressive chanteuses like Norah Jones and Alicia Keys, but she has a broader palette than either. On the soulful torch song \"Dream,\" which Smith wrote, she conveys a sophisticated allure that would seem well beyond her twenty-seven years."
